WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.300
Yeah, I had the best time.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.400
The dance floor was packed. Banger after banger.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.800
Not a single miss.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.000
You actually killed it and you actually smashed it.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.200
We couldn't have asked for a better DJ.
